{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"fangji-p-d9a6498f65e07e","name":"纪玄龙","evidence":["fangji-q-43445727e5e338a7e533"],"facts":[{"id":"fangji-f-d95dfb6c3f2920355c6f","text":"中书令史，管辂乡里人。","evidence":["fangji-q-43445727e5e338a7e533"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-43445727e5e338a7e533","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-2a797911c777e758ab03","layer":"pei","quote":"中书令史纪玄龙，辂乡里人，云：“辂在田舍，尝候远邻，主人患数失火。辂卜，教使明日于南陌上伺，当有一角巾诸生，驾黑牛故车；必引留，为设宾主，此能消之。即从辂戒。诸生有急求去，不听，遂留当宿；意大不安，以为图己。主人罢入，生乃把刀出门，倚两薪积间，侧立假寐。歘有一小物直来过前，如兽，手中持火，以口吹之。生惊，举刀斫，正断腰，视之则狐。自此主人不复有灾。”","attribution":"裴注","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":459,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-66647f1ecb147317b0c6","start":0,"end":176,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
